                </tr>
          <tr>
            <td height="25" valign="top" class="text_lables3">HACIMS (Telemedicine Solution)</td>
                </tr>
          <tr>
            <td height="10"></td>
                </tr>
          <tr>
            <td height="118" valign="top"><div align="justify" class="text_titles_normal">Hacims is a health care application covering the necessities of the hospitals in the Pakistan, regarding telemedicine solution and allowing them to communicate clinical data at National and International level. It incorporates Health Level 7 that provides standards for the exchange of data among worldwide healthcare computing applications. Several other standards are also used in conjunction with HL7 such as ICD-10 disease codes, ICD-10 procedure codes, LOINC, DICOM, IS0 3166-1 </div></td>
                </tr>
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
